		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Je viens de re désinstaller le tout. Et cette fois ci, je suis même aller dans la base de registre enlever tout posgre *</p><p>En relançant l&#039;installation j&#039;ai prit le temps de faire des captures d&#039;écran des messages d&#039;erreurs :</p><p> <a href="http://www.casimages.com/img.php?i=120315093438252964.png" rel="nofollow"><span class="postimg"><img src="http://nsa22.casimages.com/img/2012/03/15/120315093438252964.png" alt="120315093438252964.png" /></span></a></p><br /><br /><p><a href="http://www.casimages.com/img.php?i=120315093952584767.png" rel="nofollow"><span class="postimg"><img src="http://nsa21.casimages.com/img/2012/03/15/120315093952584767.png" alt="120315093952584767.png" /></span></a></p><p>le message d&#039;erreur :</p><p><a href="http://www.casimages.com/img.php?i=120315094305334600.png" rel="nofollow"><span class="postimg"><img src="http://nsa22.casimages.com/img/2012/03/15/120315094305334600.png" alt="120315094305334600.png" /></span></a></p><br /><p>Et se qui me parait bisar c&#039;est :</p><p><a href="http://www.casimages.com/img.php?i=120315094418783151.png" rel="nofollow"><span class="postimg"><img src="http://nsa21.casimages.com/img/2012/03/15/120315094418783151.png" alt="120315094418783151.png" /></span></a></p><p>J&#039;ai 3 serveurs local maintenant! Mais aucun fonctionne.</p><br /><p>Le LOG :<br /><a href="http://piratepad.net/BfzAvopP1A" rel="nofollow">http://piratepad.net/BfzAvopP1A</a></p>]]></content>
